{"id": "Q001", "card": {"answer_id": "558", "kb_version": 50, "as_of": null, "superseded_since": null, "client": null, "route": "lookup", "status": "answered", "rule": {"text": "When the invoice unit price is higher than the PO unit price, the line passes only if the total excess on that line is no more than the lower of 1% of the PO line value and ₹500. [1] If the excess exceeds that tolerance, the line is held with exception PRICE_VAR and sent to the PO buyer, who must either amend the PO or request a credit note from the supplier. [1][2] PRICE_VAR exceptions must be resolved within 3 working days. [2]", "citations": [{"n": 1, "passage_id": "6a3d60030fef8254dc43", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "short_label": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "locator": "4.2", "section_title": "Price tolerance", "doc_type": "sop", "status": "current", "quote": "Where the invoice unit price is higher than the PO unit price, the line passes only if the total excess on that line is no more than the lower of 1% of the PO line value and ₹500."}, {"n": 2, "passage_id": "74dbc50fc92df4fdefd9", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "short_label": "AP SOP v4.0 §10", "locator": "10", "section_title": "Exceptions", "doc_type": "sop", "status": "current", "quote": "PRICE_VAR | Unit price above tolerance (4.2) | PO buyer | 3 working days"}]}, "working": null, "decision": "Tolerance is the lower of 1% of PO line value and ₹500 per line", "exception_code": null, "next_owner": null, "older_sources": [{"topic": "Price tolerance", "current_value": "₹500", "older_value": "₹1,000", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v3.1_2023.docx", "locator": "AP SOP v3.1", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}, {"topic": "Price tolerance", "current_value": "₹500", "older_value": "₹1,000", "file": "PS-07_desk_instructions_and_client_memos.docx", "locator": "Part F", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}, {"topic": "Price tolerance", "current_value": "1%", "older_value": "2%", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v3.1_2023.docx", "locator": "AP SOP v3.1", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}, {"topic": "Price tolerance", "current_value": "1%", "older_value": "2%", "file": "PS-07_desk_instructions_and_client_memos.docx", "locator": "Part F", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}], "expert_tip": null, "route_to": null, "entities": [{"id": "9cb1508079ee39e919a9", "name": "invoice", "type": "invoice"}, {"id": "69f1ff173bd382fbf19b", "name": "Price tolerance", "type": "topic"}], "related": ["What happens if the invoice price is lower than the PO price?", "Who is responsible for resolving a PRICE_VAR exception?", "What is the time limit for resolving a PRICE_VAR exception?"], "latency_ms": 16749, "diagnostics": {"timings_s": {"route": 3.55, "retrieve": 10.07, "answer_and_check": 0.37, "attempts": 1}, "router": {"route": "lookup", "client": null, "confidence": 0.95, "out_of_scope_reason": "", "role": "ap_processor"}, "retrieval": {"scorer": "rerank", "top_score": 8.866462707519531, "passages": [["AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "6a3d60030fef8254dc43", 8.866], ["Video 1 [04:30]", "732c3af92baad708588f", 3.651], ["DI-03 Part A, step 4", "be14f644503dd76f141c", 3.136], ["AP SOP v4.0 §10", "74dbc50fc92df4fdefd9", -0.291], ["Video 3 [03:10]", "a1c5bb42d73893644924", -1.588], ["Video 1 [06:55]", "fbbb4c331e748fe5fa18", -2.793]], "facts": [627, 826, 824, 631, 628, 330, 632, 633, 538, 585]}, "verifier": {"verified": true, "problems": [], "attempts": []}}}}
{"id": "Q002", "card": {"answer_id": "557", "kb_version": 50, "as_of": null, "superseded_since": null, "client": null, "route": "lookup", "status": "answered", "rule": {"text": "Under the general rule, invoice quantity must not exceed the GRN quantity and there is no quantity tolerance for any client. [1] The only exception is the bulk-material tolerance agreed with Arvana Infra Projects in Client Memo CM-INF-02. [1] For Arvana Infra Projects, cement, reinforcement steel, sand, and aggregates may be invoiced up to 5% above the GRN quantity provided the excess value on the invoice does not exceed ₹25,000. [2] If the invoice quantity exceeds the GRN quantity (or exceeds the 5%/₹25,000 limits for Arvana's four bulk materials), the exception code QTY_VAR must be raised. [3][2]", "citations": [{"n": 1, "passage_id": "650ec83794239ad8d60e", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "short_label": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.3", "locator": "4.3", "section_title": "Quantity tolerance", "doc_type": "sop", "status": "current", "quote": "Invoice quantity must not exceed the GRN quantity. There is no quantity tolerance for any client, except the bulk-material tolerance agreed with Arvana Infra Projects in Client Memo CM-INF-02"}, {"n": 2, "passage_id": "502134b3a6eaf7905636", "file": "PS-07_desk_instructions_and_client_memos.docx", "short_label": "CM-INF-02 Part C", "locator": "Part C", "section_title": "Client memo CM-INF-02 (Arvana Infra Projects)", "doc_type": "memo", "status": "current", "quote": "For these four materials only, an invoice quantity up to 5% above the GRN quantity is accepted, provided the excess value on the invoice does not exceed ₹25,000."}, {"n": 3, "passage_id": "cb3b3995fd3452919d41", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "short_label": "AP SOP v4.0 §10", "locator": "10", "section_title": "Exceptions", "doc_type": "sop", "status": "current", "quote": "QTY_VAR | Invoice quantity above GRN (4.3) | Requester | 3 working days"}]}, "working": null, "decision": "No general tolerance; only Arvana Infra Projects has a 5% tolerance for four bulk materials with a ₹25,000 value cap.", "exception_code": null, "next_owner": null, "older_sources": [{"topic": "Quantity tolerance", "current_value": "specific_materials", "older_value": "client-specific bulk materials (Arvana Infra Projects per CM-INF-02)", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "locator": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.3", "superseded_by": "CM-INF-02 Part C", "superseded_on": "2026-04-15"}, {"topic": "Quantity tolerance", "current_value": "specific_materials", "older_value": "specific materials (Infra bulk materials per client memo)", "file": "PS-07_training_and_expert_transcripts.docx", "locator": "Video 1 [06:55]", "superseded_by": "CM-INF-02 Part C", "superseded_on": "2026-04-15"}, {"topic": "Quantity tolerance", "current_value": "0%", "older_value": "2%", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v3.1_2023.docx", "locator": "AP SOP v3.1", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.3", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}, {"topic": "quantity_tolerance.infra_material_percentage", "current_value": "5%", "older_value": "10%", "file": "PS-07_desk_instructions_and_client_memos.docx", "locator": "Part F", "superseded_by": "CM-INF-02 Part C", "superseded_on": "2026-04-15", "reason": "Part F, dated 09 Oct 2023 is stale; CM-INF-02 Part C, dated 15 Apr 2026 is current (for Arvana Infra Projects)."}], "expert_tip": null, "route_to": null, "entities": [{"id": "ffe6f9529e43bb88d336", "name": "GRN", "type": "goodsreceiptnote"}, {"id": "9cb1508079ee39e919a9", "name": "invoice", "type": "invoice"}, {"id": "62be7ee9c99e4142b405", "name": "Quantity tolerance", "type": "topic"}, {"id": "7b06e27e7932ae9f095d", "name": "e-invoice limit", "type": "irn"}], "related": ["What is the process to raise a QTY_VAR exception?", "Does the 5% tolerance apply to any materials other than cement, reinforcement steel, sand, and aggregates for Arvana Infra Projects?", "What happens if the excess value exceeds ₹25,000 for Arvana Infra Projects?"], "latency_ms": 14457, "diagnostics": {"timings_s": {"route": 2.31, "retrieve": 8.99, "answer_and_check": 0.44, "attempts": 1}, "router": {"route": "lookup", "client": null, "confidence": 0.95, "out_of_scope_reason": "", "role": "ap_processor"}, "retrieval": {"scorer": "rerank", "top_score": 8.803911209106445, "passages": [["AP SOP v4.0 §4.3", "650ec83794239ad8d60e", 8.804], ["CM-INF-02 Part C", "502134b3a6eaf7905636", 5.274], ["AP SOP v4.0 §14", "c568a0927babd550c386", 3.331], ["Video 1 [04:30]", "732c3af92baad708588f", 1.483], ["AP SOP v4.0 §10", "cb3b3995fd3452919d41", 1.331], ["Video 1 [06:55]", "fbbb4c331e748fe5fa18", 0.06]], "facts": [583, 447, 547, 80, 79, 637, 97, 538, 81, 585]}, "citations_added": 1, "verifier": {"verified": true, "problems": [], "attempts": []}}}}
{"id": "Q003", "card": {"answer_id": "559", "kb_version": 50, "as_of": null, "superseded_since": null, "client": null, "route": "lookup", "status": "answered", "rule": {"text": "Rounding differences up to ₹10 at invoice-total level caused by line-level tax rounding are accepted automatically and posted to the rounding-difference account. [1] Anything above ₹10 is treated as a mismatch. [1]", "citations": [{"n": 1, "passage_id": "66d167d7f1807dac8991", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v4.0_2026.docx", "short_label": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.4", "locator": "4.4", "section_title": "Rounding", "doc_type": "sop", "status": "current", "quote": "Differences of up to ₹10 at invoice-total level caused by line-level tax rounding are accepted automatically and posted to the rounding-difference account."}]}, "working": null, "decision": "Up to ₹10 auto-accepted", "exception_code": null, "next_owner": null, "older_sources": [{"topic": "Rounding difference tolerance", "current_value": "₹10", "older_value": "₹50", "file": "PS-07_AP_SOP_v3.1_2023.docx", "locator": "AP SOP v3.1", "superseded_by": "AP SOP v4.0 §4.4", "superseded_on": "2026-04-01"}], "expert_tip": {"text": "Transporters add '/A' or '-REV' suffixes when resending the same invoice.", "author": "Lakshmi", "date": "2026-09-08", "citation": {"n": 0, "passage_id": "f67b136daa068ef58540", "file": "PS-07_training_and_expert_transcripts.docx", "short_label": "Expert interview 1 [02:30]", "locator": "Expert interview 1 [02:30]", "section_title": "Lakshmi Reddy, Senior Processor", "doc_type": "interview", "status": "record", "quote": "Three or four transporters add '/A' or '-REV' when they resend the same invoice."}, "approved_by": null}, "route_to": null, "entities": [{"id": "15b389b980c8dad0d506", "name": "Rounding difference tolerance", "type": "topic"}], "related": ["What happens if the rounding difference exceeds ₹10?", "Is the ₹10 limit per invoice or per line?", "Does this apply to all clients or only specific ones?"], "latency_ms": 7919, "diagnostics": {"timings_s": {"route": 2.17, "retrieve": 4.31, "answer_and_check": 0.34, "attempts": 1}, "router": {"route": "lookup", "client": null, "confidence": 0.9, "out_of_scope_reason": "", "role": "ap_processor"}, "retrieval": {"scorer": "rerank", "top_score": 5.198871612548828, "passages": [["AP SOP v4.0 §4.4", "66d167d7f1807dac8991", 5.199], ["AP SOP v4.0 §14", "6a6b443d785bac04631f", 0.215], ["AP SOP v4.0 §4.6", "26bda74a5f1666174528", -7.016], ["AP SOP v4.0 §4.2", "6a3d60030fef8254dc43", -7.047], ["AP SOP v4.0 §4.3", "650ec83794239ad8d60e", -7.872], ["DI-03 Part A, step 4", "be14f644503dd76f141c", -8.27]], "facts": [820, 583, 824, 447, 628, 627, 826, 647, 603, 602]}, "verifier": {"verified": true, "problems": [], "attempts": []}}}}
